id: feral-fist-unforeseen-ferocity
name: Unforeseen Ferocity
order: 2
slot: burst
description: >
  Your feral nature overwhelms and subdues not only your conscious mind, but also your enemies.
text: >
  Unforeseen Ferocity: Your feral nature overwhelms and subdues not only your conscious mind, but also your enemies.
  (1)-[Triggered/Transform]: Gain 3 stacks of Ferocity. Additionally, enter the Unhinged level of the Feral State until the end of your next turn.

---

# Burst Limit: 3 stacks of Ferocity; the Feral State's Unhinged Level till the end of your next turn.
[triggered/transform, 1/encounter, effect 1]
ferocity.stacks = 3;
enterState(feral, 2, next-turn);
